      "writtenOn": "2017-01-19T10:23:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually the default power role is something known at compile time.\nRather than adding more function calls and special cases,\nI would just transform the PD_ROLE_DEFAULT macro/define into a PD_ROLE_DEFAULT(port) macro.\nusb_pd.h can be updated to define by default a macro swallowing the \u0027port\u0027 parameter:\n#ifdef CONFIG_USB_PD_DUAL_ROLE\n#define PD_ROLE_DEFAULT(port) PD_ROLE_SINK\n#else\n#define PD_ROLE_DEFAULT(port) PD_ROLE_SOURCE\n#endif\n\nAnd override it with your special logic for servo_v4\n#define PD_ROLE_DEFAULT(port) ((port) ? PD_ROLE_SOURCE :\tPD_ROLE_SINK)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1627,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1642,
        "endChar": 19
      },
      "revId": "ac07f3482a5f69072520bb5bf0b9aea0b5603b7c",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
